# Project boundary

Do not create, edit, delete, install, or otherwise change anything outside this project directory (`openrb-pcf`).

- No copies into `~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins` or any other system location.
- Built VST3, AU, and standalone go to the project `output/` folder. `COPY_PLUGIN_AFTER_BUILD` may be TRUE only when copy dirs are under that folder.
- Do not modify `openrb-338` or any other sibling project.
- Do not write to home-directory config, global toolchains, or user Library folders as part of this project.
